      "value": "The idea itself is not that bad. But i dont think that this is helping in any way. Content Creators should take care about their avatars and the performance specialy when you share them with everyone in a public world. We all have already enough rights you can do what ever you want to. The only thing you should take care of that no one is anoying any other player.",
