      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a49664b513e7625f7f9509e|full_name}: Hiding and showing avatars are completely different from individual shaders. You can hide through safety yes, but then you will only hide avatars of the same user level. Plus it's annoying trying to block and unblock an person changing their avatar.\n\nI don't agree with the idea of stopping deletion of avatars though. Deleting avatars is a good thing at this stage of the game. It's pretty much a warning telling you to stop doing this.\n\nIn my perspective, having a setting to disable avatars like this is just a quality of life improvement for people like me who just want all these annoying avatars to go away without me having to constantly unblock them whenever they are in a safe avatar. You have to agree that looking at a grey man is pretty boring.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
