  "details": "Hello to all my name is Neko: 3 I ask you to read this and share it with everyone.\n\nI want to make sure that the vrchat avatar creators get more rights. Since some of my friends have been banned for their avatars (public animation avatars), I request another option in the vrchat sdk (button annoying avatar or something similar) as there are such features there are also avatars for gore and 18+. This option in the SDK should be an important part of the Safty Settings (annoying avatars on / off in each category)\n\nMore info About The annoying avatar button\n\n-When akiv, players can decide in the Safty settings themselves if they want to see avatars with such animations.\n\n-When do I know when to use the button?\n\nOnce the avatar has a loud audio (boosted volume or range).\nOnce full screen shader is used on an avatar (screen shake or fractal shader etc.).\n-By too many particles are active (particle spam).\n\nSuch avatars should nevertheless be put on public worlds!\nWith the Safty Settings anyone can decide whether he wants to see such avatars or not !!\n\nAdded this And stop deleting such avatars and ban the creator! If you add this option and people upload such avatars without the option, it is ok to distribute a warning / ban.\n\nBut it can not stay the way it is at the moment !! So I ask the Vrchat devs to be more gracious in their content creator.",
